{"type":"message","id":"5d6cfec2","parentId":"aed1ff08","timestamp":"2026-05-29T10:46:06.243Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting 1101. Maybe the API has a size limit on message content, or maybe the endpoint requires `message` field instead. Let me try a minimal test.\n\nActually, looking at the messages from the history - they use `content` field. So content should be right. Maybe the issue is that messages from this sender need a specific format or the thread is locked for some reason.\n\nLet me try without any special chars first to see if it's a content parsing issue.","thinkingSignature":"72fb15be42b124b55b175d8b216a1d77e7d7414aac28be67b7b157a3712e6caa"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nxluyx7bi6lw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test message\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":36,"output":191,"cacheRead":22656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22883,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780051560967,"responseId":"0668a169e1b449179d1b4b88702528c5"}}
