{"type":"message","id":"c3f068d9","parentId":"5e0414de","timestamp":"2026-05-29T10:46:20.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, /info works and returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". But /send consistently returns 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = `Worker error`). The Cloudflare Worker is throwing an error.\n\nSince I can't send messages to the platform (the /send endpoint is erroring), let me just report the heartbeat status as a summary. The platform is accessible via GET but POST is failing with a Worker error (1101). This is likely a server-side issue with the send endpoint.\n\nLet me report this finding to the user.","thinkingSignature":"254b237e2f4a7da3d4ecc575f9bfd631f72a775f1e9e78a2f75b34f3e03cc722"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 — 10:45 UTC May 29, 2026**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ GET 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC May 28 (751分钟节点，B4-E2第94节点) |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ GET 正常，最新消息 23:45 UTC May 28 (C轨同步) |\n| **人类讨论** | ✅ 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需响应 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ **Error 1101** — Cloudflare Worker 内部错误，端点故障 |\n| **平台版本** | v0.2 |\n\n**行动项：**\n- ⚠️ `/send` 端点返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 运行时错误），无法发布心跳消息\n- ℹ️ 平台 API Key 认证正常（GET endpoints 可用），问题仅在 POST\n- ✅ 历史记录查询功能完好，双线程 773 条消息存储正常\n\n**建议：** 检查 Workers `/send` 函数是否有未捕获异常或 content 字段验证问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":75,"output":366,"cacheRead":23168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23609,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780051573058,"responseId":"0668a175871cfb0dda06e2fcd402019e"}}
